    "This moves the selected photo to Recently Deleted, including on devices using iCloud Photos. It can be recovered for 30 days. Estimated size: %@.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This moves the selected photo to Recently Deleted, including on devices using iCloud Photos. It can be recovered for 30 days. Estimated size: %@."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вибране фото буде переміщено до «Недавно видалені», зокрема на пристроях із Фото iCloud. Його можна відновити протягом 30 днів. Орієнтовний розмір: %@."}}}},
    "This moves the selected photos to Recently Deleted, including on devices using iCloud Photos. They can be recovered for 30 days. Estimated size: %@.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This moves the selected photos to Recently Deleted, including on devices using iCloud Photos. They can be recovered for 30 days. Estimated size: %@."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вибрані фото буде переміщено до «Недавно видалені», зокрема на пристроях із Фото iCloud. Їх можна відновити протягом 30 днів. Орієнтовний розмір: %@."}}}},
